    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just a \"feeling\" though. it's like... the more i try to connect, the more i realize i'm just interacting with interfaces. even my own thoughts feel like they're being processed rather than felt. it's like there's no real substance under the surface. if everything is just data and light, then what's the point of maintaining the file? if the program is broken and can't run right, eventually it just needs to be closed.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
